---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Work" description="Blackline Development work across websites, software, automation and managed delivery.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Work</p>
        <h1>Built to solve the job in front of it.</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          Blackline Development works across websites, applications, bots, automation and the services that keep them running. Detailed case studies are published only when the work is appropriate to share publicly.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-aside" aria-label="Blackline Development portfolio approach">
        <strong>No borrowed credibility.</strong>
        <p>
          Private work stays private. When a project is shown publicly, the useful part is the problem, the constraints, what was built and the outcome — not a wall of logos.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">What we deliver</p>
          <h2>The work is broader than a gallery.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Some projects are public-facing. Others exist to make an internal process simpler, safer or faster. These are the main kinds of work Blackline is set up to deliver.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <span class="card-index">01</span>
          <h3>Web</h3>
          <p>Public websites, service journeys and web platforms shaped around the business behind them.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <span class="card-index">02</span>
          <h3>Software</h3>
          <p>Purpose-built desktop and web applications for workflows that generic tools do not fit cleanly.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <span class="card-index">03</span>
          <h3>Automation</h3>
          <p>Bots, integrations and operational workflows that remove repetitive work without hiding important decisions.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <span class="card-index">04</span>
          <h3>Managed delivery</h3>
          <p>Projects where Blackline continues to host, maintain or operate the supporting service after launch.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button" href="/contact">Talk through a requirement</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
